---
import MarketingLayout from '@layouts/MarketingLayout.astro';
---

<MarketingLayout
  title="Testimonials &middot; Autoeight"
  description="Real words from UK businesses Autoeight built with. Short reviews from clients across training, e-commerce, trades, and community platforms."
  canonical="https://autoeight.ai/results/testimonials"
  ogType="website"
  ogTitle="Testimonials &middot; Autoeight"
  ogDescription="Real words from UK businesses Autoeight built with. Short reviews from clients across training, e-commerce, trades, and community platforms."
  twitterTitle="Testimonials &middot; Autoeight"
>
  <script type="application/ld+json">
  {
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "BreadcrumbList",
    "itemListElement": [
      {
        "@type": "ListItem",
        "position": 1,
        "name": "Home",
        "item": "https://autoeight.ai/"
      },
      {
        "@type": "ListItem",
        "position": 2,
        "name": "Results",
        "item": "https://autoeight.ai/results/"
      },
      {
        "@type": "ListItem",
        "position": 3,
        "name": "Testimonials",
        "item": "https://autoeight.ai/results/testimonials"
      }
    ]
  }
  </script>

  <div class="page-hero">
    <div class="page-hero-bg"></div>
    <div class="page-hero-grid"></div>
    <div class="page-hero-content">
      <span class="section-label">Testimonials</span>
      <h1>What our <em>clients say</em></h1>
      <p>Honest feedback from UK businesses we've worked with. Short quotes, real numbers, real names.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <section class="page-section">
    <div class="page-section-inner">

      <div class="tst-intro reveal">
        <p>Every quote below is from a real UK client. No retainers, no edits for flattery. If we built it and they stuck around, this is what they said about the work.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="tst-grid reveal">

        <!-- 1 Matrix TSL -->
        <article class="tst-card">
          <span class="tst-quote-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-quote-left"></i></span>
          <p class="tst-quote">They studied our sales process for two weeks before writing a line of code. The result does what we actually need, not what an off-the-shelf tool pretends to need.</p>
          <span class="tst-metric"><i class="fa-solid fa-clock"></i> 3 hrs/day saved</span>
          <div class="tst-author">
            <strong>James R.</strong>
            <span>Sales Director &middot; Matrix TSL</span>
          </div>
        </article>

        <!-- 2 TM Joinery -->
        <article class="tst-card">
          <span class="tst-quote-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-quote-left"></i></span>
          <p class="tst-quote">We went from invisible on Google to page one in six towns. Phone actually rings now.</p>
          <span class="tst-metric"><i class="fa-solid fa-magnifying-glass"></i> Page 1 in 6 regions</span>
          <div class="tst-author">
            <strong>Tom M.</strong>
            <span>Owner &middot; TM Joinery</span>
          </div>
        </article>

        <!-- 3 The Dice Tavern -->
        <article class="tst-card">
          <span class="tst-quote-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-quote-left"></i></span>
          <p class="tst-quote">We used to hand over 15% to a marketplace. Now that's ours. Paid for the build in under six months.</p>
          <span class="tst-metric"><i class="fa-solid fa-sterling-sign"></i> 0% marketplace fees</span>
          <div class="tst-author">
            <strong>Dave P.</strong>
            <span>Owner &middot; The Dice Tavern</span>
          </div>
        </article>

        <!-- 4 Northfield Training -->
        <article class="tst-card">
          <span class="tst-quote-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-quote-left"></i></span>
          <p class="tst-quote">Three platforms became one. Admin time dropped by 85% and our completion rate almost tripled.</p>
          <span class="tst-metric"><i class="fa-solid fa-graduation-cap"></i> 82% completions (up from 30%)</span>
          <div class="tst-author">
            <strong>Rachel K.</strong>
            <span>Head of L&amp;D &middot; Northfield Training</span>
          </div>
        </article>

        <!-- 5 RoundTable -->
        <article class="tst-card">
          <span class="tst-quote-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-quote-left"></i></span>
          <p class="tst-quote">We stopped running a Discord server and started running a real platform. The community basically manages itself now.</p>
          <span class="tst-metric"><i class="fa-solid fa-dice-d20"></i> Sign-up to booking in 2 minutes</span>
          <div class="tst-author">
            <strong>Morgan H.</strong>
            <span>Founder &middot; RoundTable</span>
          </div>
        </article>

        <!-- 6 Independent Tutor -->
        <article class="tst-card">
          <span class="tst-quote-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-quote-left"></i></span>
          <p class="tst-quote">I was paying &pound;2,400 a year to use someone else's tool. Now I own it outright and keep 100% of every sale.</p>
          <span class="tst-metric"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check"></i> &pound;0/mo platform fees</span>
          <div class="tst-author">
            <strong>Sarah L.</strong>
            <span>Founder &middot; Independent Tutor</span>
          </div>
        </article>

        <!-- 7 Learn With Lorna -->
        <article class="tst-card">
          <span class="tst-quote-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-quote-left"></i></span>
          <p class="tst-quote">Students now have their own community, not just a course folder. Retention has jumped.</p>
          <span class="tst-metric"><i class="fa-solid fa-people-group"></i> Custom LMS, owned outright</span>
          <div class="tst-author">
            <strong>Lorna V.</strong>
            <span>Founder &middot; Learn With Lorna</span>
          </div>
        </article>

        <!-- 8 Matrix TSL (second) -->
        <article class="tst-card">
          <span class="tst-quote-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-quote-left"></i></span>
          <p class="tst-quote">29 tools down to 1. That alone gave us back a full day a week per person.</p>
          <span class="tst-metric"><i class="fa-solid fa-layer-group"></i> 29 &rarr; 1 tool</span>
          <div class="tst-author">
            <strong>James R.</strong>
            <span>Sales Director &middot; Matrix TSL</span>
          </div>
        </article>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="page-cta">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="cta-box reveal">
        <div class="cta-glow"></div>
        <h2>Want to be our next good review?</h2>
        <p>Book a free 30-minute call and we'll work out where we can help most.</p>
        <a href="../book" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg"><i class="fa-solid fa-calendar-check"></i> Book your free audit</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Review JSON-LD schema -->
  <script type="application/ld+json">
  {
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "Review",
    "itemReviewed": {
      "@type": "Organization",
      "name": "Autoeight",
      "url": "https://autoeight.ai/"
    },
    "reviewRating": { "@type": "Rating", "ratingValue": "5", "bestRating": "5" },
